.TH "SKOGAI RUNNER-WO-RUN" 1  "skogai runner-wo-run 0.0.0" 
.SH NAME
skogai runner\-wo\-run \- run a workorder, write <name>.result.json beside it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBskogai runner wo run\fR [OPTIONS] <WORKORDER>
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-model\fR=\fIMODEL\fR
.br
model, default the workorder's or runner.model
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
.br
Print help
.TP
<\fIWORKORDER\fR>
.br
name or path
